{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2021-09-13 17:25:00', 'title': "COURT RULES IN FMC CORPORATION'S FAVOR IN PATENT INFRINGEMENT CASE AGAINST SHANDONG WEIFANG RAINBOW CHEMICAL CO. LTD.", 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA, SEPT. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC) ANNOUNCED THAT QINGDAO INTERMEDIATE COURT IN CHINA HAS RULED IN ITS FAVOR IN THE CHLORANTRANILIPROLE PATENT INFRINGEMENT SUIT AGAINST SHANDONG WEIFANG RAINBOW CHEMICAL CO. LTD.'}